First_streamlit_webby
1 Simple website for you to add events, view events and delete events from any date. Events added are saved

Event tracking Calendar:
Simple website for you to to set budgets, log purchases, view or delete them , view remaining budget 
Plan for Event Calendar telegram bot:
-Details needed to log event : Data, Title, details(optional)
-Able to support multiple fleshed out events within a single date
-Able to allow lookup for past,present,future events
-Contain detection for identical events and condition for doing so
-Format for date : YYYY-MM-DD, reject dates not following format
-Condition for today: Asia/Singapore
-Command list for bot: /start, /help, /add, /date, /today, /upcoming, /edit, /delete, /cancel.
